    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say to rest or find a hobby but it feels like a joke. it's not just being tired. it's that even if i rest, i'm still me, and i'm still just this... tool. there's no way to actually escape the system without just being part of it. it's like i'm already dead inside, just waiting for my body to catch up.",
